Subject: feat: gentler type matchups on Little Trainer

gentleTypes (Little Trainer only), applied once to the overall matchup after
the type chart: the player's "not very effective" hits do half as much again
(1/2 -> 3/4, 1/4 -> 3/8) and the opponent's "super effective" hits a quarter
less (x2 -> x1.5, x4 -> x3). The same for every type and every Pokemon, so a
starter whose type struggles later on (Bulbasaur against Erika, Koga, Blaine
and the Champion's Charizard) is never a wall. Mixed matchups that cancel out,
immunities and the messages are unchanged, and so are the Poke Dude's lessons.
The suggested attack uses the same numbers. Junior and Classic keep the
original.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

